   "created_at": "2024-04-13T11:09:33+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>A tip for you and anyone else creating custom trader icons: when the icon images are in a larger image format, Tarkov will downscale them, ironically reducing the detail and making them look pixelated. I got this from another creator who downsized his own pack to 200x200. I did the same for this pack and it looks a lot better!</p>\n<p>Great icon pack by the way!</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 1
